  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A thermally isolated, sealed container contains a fixed mass of ideal gas. The container is floating downstream in a river. The graph below shows how the speed of the container varies with time.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is true about the temperature and the internal energy of the gas as the container travels downstream?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Temperature</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Internal energy</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Constant</td>\n<td>Constant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Constant</td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n<td>Constant</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
